元年，不从相邻段落推算。","evidence":["hancui-q-c2747388a780e24168d1"]},"ordering_evidence":"hancui-q-c2747388a780e24168d1","order":5010},{"id":"hancui-e-405e4d84590f45a870ca","title":"王观上印归里","accounts":[{"id":"hancui-a-405e4d84590f45a870ca","label":"正文","text":"王观上印归里","evidence":["hancui-q-46bdc4bbf9888ddee76b"]}],"participants":[{"person":"shaodi-p0139","role":"辞印归里","evidence":["hancui-q-46bdc4bbf9888ddee76b"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"未审定公元年，不从相邻段落推算。","evidence":["hancui-q-46bdc4bbf9888ddee76b"]},"ordering_evidence":"hancui-q-46bdc4bbf9888ddee76b","order":5011}],"persons":[{"id":"shaodi-p0139","name":"王观","evidence":["shaodi-q-o154","huanchen-q-627a3664fd282b81a666","hancui-q-2173719b8aa4c8d14006","hancui-q-6ff78d9179e1e4276416","hancui-q-856acd66bef3b649b9f2","hancui-q-f0ab668bcfd47a9610f4","hancui-q-c2747388a780e24168d1","hancui-q-33c9910c0fd5016b5582","hancui-q-0a903800b9c62055c871","hancui-q-f03fcea8ad9738dbe3b2","hancui-q-1d8da776754b89772037","hancui-q-76c065e91fa3ec6e3106","hancui-q-23e51a08691015013817","hancui-q-8f8fed52fd4e2fb559b8","hancui-q-738e2ddc342002616abb","hancui-q-46bdc4bbf9888ddee76b","hancui-q-fac958a65ddcbedf8a10"],"facts":[{"id":"hancui-f-2fdec9c6484b9ed1a8ee","text":"字伟台，东郡廪丘人。","evidence":["hancui-q-2173719b8aa4c8d14006"]}],"aliases":[],"mentions":[{"id":"shaodi-m-o154-shaodi-p0139","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["shaodi-q-o154"]},{"id":"shaodi-m-o155-shaodi-p0139","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["shaodi-q-o155"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"hancui-q-0a903800b9c62055c871","section":"chapter-024","block":"b-7b7615a4d2bb51b981f1","layer":"original","quote":"文帝践阼，入为尚书郎、廷尉监〖4〗。出为南阳、涿郡太守。","section_title":"韩崔高孙王传第二十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0054.xhtml","index":416,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":28,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"hancui-q-1d8da776754b89772037","section":"chapter-024","block":"b-3d2dbc6e9a044a87179a","layer":"original","quote":"太尉司马宣王请观为从事中郎。迁为尚书，出为河南尹。徙少府。","section_title":"韩崔高孙王传第二十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0054.xhtml","index":419,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":29,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"hancui-q-2173719b8aa4c8d14006","section":"chapter-024","block":"b-2c4fbc2f2d5414505749","layer":"original","quote":"王观字伟台，东郡廪丘人也〖1〗。少孤贫励志。太祖召为丞相文学掾〖2〗，出为高唐、阳泉、酂、任令〖3〗，所在称治。","section_title":"韩崔高孙王传第二十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0054.xhtml","index":415,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":56,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"hancui-q-23e51a08691015013817","section":"chapter-024","block":"b-3d2dbc6e9a044a87179a","layer":"original","quote":"少府统三尚方御府内藏玩弄之宝〖15〗，爽等奢放，多有干求；惮观守法，乃徙为太仆〖16〗。","section_title":"韩崔高孙王传第二十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0054.xhtml","index":419,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":71,"end":115,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"hancui-q-33c9910c0fd5016b5582","section":"chapter-024","block":"b-25917e95355d3ef3f81a","layer":"original","quote":"迁司空，固辞；不许，遣使即第拜授。","section_title":"韩崔高孙王传第二十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0054.xhtml","index":421,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":54,"end":71,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"hancui-q-46bdc4bbf9888ddee76b","section":"chapter-024","block":"b-4a613e7edf2c38cbe51b","layer":"original","quote":"就官数日，上送印绶，辄自舆归里舍。","section_title":"韩崔高孙王传第二十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0054.xhtml","index":422,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":17,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"hancui-q-6ff78d9179e1e4276416","section":"chapter-024","block":"b-5a08ff2bcae0dbc73de2","layer":"original","quote":"明帝即位，下诏书使郡县条为剧、中、平者〖8〗。主者欲言郡为中、平，观教曰：“此郡滨近外虏，数有寇害，云何不为剧邪〖9〗？”主者曰：“若郡为外剧，恐于明府有任子〖10〗。”观曰：“夫君者，所以为民也。今郡在外剧，则于役条当有降差〖11〗。岂可为太守之私，而负一郡之民乎？”遂言为外剧郡，后送任子诣邺。时观但有一子而又幼弱。其公心如此。","section_title":"韩崔高孙王传第二十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0054.xhtml","index":417,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":166,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"hancui-q-738e2ddc342002616abb","section":"chapter-024","block":"b-78b4afa1027582ad6ad2","layer":"original","quote":"赐爵关内侯，复为尚书，加驸马都尉。","section_title":"韩崔高孙王传第二十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0054.xhtml","index":420,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":20,"end":37,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"hancui-q-76c065e91fa3ec6e3106","section":"chapter-024","block":"b-3d2dbc6e9a044a87179a","layer":"original","quote":"大将军曹爽使材官张达〖13〗，斫家屋材，及诸私用之物；观闻知，皆录夺以没官〖14〗。","section_title":"韩崔高孙王传第二十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0054.xhtml","index":419,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":29,"end":71,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"hancui-q-856acd66bef3b649b9f2","section":"chapter-024","block":"b-b6598ad381795404a24f","layer":"original","quote":"观治身清素，帅下以俭，僚属承风，莫不自励。明帝幸许昌，召观为治书侍御史，典行台狱。时多有仓猝喜怒〖12〗，而观不阿意顺指。","section_title":"韩崔高孙王传第二十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0054.xhtml","index":418,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":61,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"hancui-q-8f8fed52fd4e2fb559b8","section":"chapter-024","block":"b-78b4afa1027582ad6ad2","layer":"original","quote":"司马宣王诛爽，使观行中领军，据爽弟羲营","section_title":"韩崔高孙王传第二十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0054.xhtml","index":420,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":19,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"hancui-q-c2747388a780e24168d1","section":"chapter-024","block":"b-25917e95355d3ef3f81a","layer":"original","quote":"常道乡公即位，进封阳乡侯，增邑千户，并前二千五百户。","section_title":"韩崔高孙王传第二十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0054.xhtml","index":421,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":28,"end":54,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"hancui-q-f03fcea8ad9738dbe3b2","section":"chapter-024","block":"b-7b7615a4d2bb51b981f1","layer":"original","quote":"涿北接鲜卑，数有寇盗。观令边民十家以上，屯居，筑京候〖5〗。时或有不愿者，观乃假遣朝吏〖6〗，使归助子弟；不与期会〖7〗，但敕事讫各还。于是吏民相率，不督自劝，旬日之中，一时俱成。守御有备，寇抄以息。","section_title":"韩崔高孙王传第二十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0054.xhtml","index":416,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":28,"end":128,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"hancui-q-f0ab668bcfd47a9610f4","section":"chapter-024","block":"b-25917e95355d3ef3f81a","layer":"original","quote":"高贵乡公即位，封中乡亭侯。顷之，加光禄大夫，转为右仆射。","section_title":"韩崔高孙王传第二十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0054.xhtml","index":421,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":28,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"hancui-q-fac958a65ddcbedf8a10","section":"chapter-024","block":"b-4a613e7edf2c38cbe51b","layer":"original","quote":"薨于家，遗令藏足容棺〖17〗，不设明器〖18〗，不封不树〖19〗。谥曰肃侯。","section_title":"韩崔高孙王传第二十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0054.xhtml","index":422,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":17,"end":55,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"huanchen-q-627a3664fd282b81a666","section":"chapter-022","block":"b-c7161a1c14768cfd0ce1","layer":"original","quote":"正元三年，疾病，逊位。迁为司空，固推骠骑将军王昶、光禄大夫王观、司隶校尉王祥〖10〗。诏使使者即授印绶，进爵封容城侯，邑二千三百户","section_title":"桓二陈徐卫卢传第二十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0050.xhtml","index":586,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":65,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"shaodi-e-o154b-q","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-e338619a5503030f1d3a","layer":"original","quote":"己未〖6〗，故汉献帝夫人节，薨；帝临于华林园〖7〗。使使持节，追谥夫人为献穆皇后。及葬，车服制度皆如汉氏故事。癸亥〖8〗，以尚书右仆射王观为司空〖9〗。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_001.xhtml","index":130,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":76,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"shaodi-e-o155a-q","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-5c534f2f5acf2ca3676f","layer":"original","quote":"冬十月，观薨。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_001.xhtml","index":131,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":7,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"shaodi-q-b-77066dd061eb6a338ffa","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-77066dd061eb6a338ffa","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗五年：甘露五年（公元 260 ）。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_001.xhtml","index":50,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-21e90e29c9fd438bba21","start":0,"end":20,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"shaodi-q-o139","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-c33fc441ae4a3de17fb6","layer":"original","quote":"五年春正月朔〖1〗，日有食之。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_001.xhtml","index":45,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":15,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"shaodi-q-o154","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-e338619a5503030f1d3a","layer":"original","quote":"己未〖6〗，故汉献帝夫人节，薨；帝临于华林园〖7〗。使使持节，追谥夫人为献穆皇后。及葬，车服制度皆如汉氏故事。癸亥〖8〗，以尚书右仆射王观为司空〖9〗。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_001.xhtml","index":130,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":76,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"shaodi-q-o155","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-5c534f2f5acf2ca3676f","layer":"original","quote":"冬十月，观薨。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_001.xhtml","index":131,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":7,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
